01:28:14,000 --> 01:28:16,000
WHAT CAN HE
HAVE TO SAY?

1719
01:28:16,000 --> 01:28:18,000
HE BEGINS WITH
CONGRATULATIONS

1720
01:28:18,000 --> 01:28:20,000
ON THE APPROACHING NUPTIALS
OF MY ELDEST DAUGHTER

1721
01:28:20,000 --> 01:28:23,000
BUT I SHAN'T SPORT
WITH YOUR INTELLIGENCE

1722
01:28:23,000 --> 01:28:25,000
BY READING HIS REMARKS
ON THAT TOPIC.

1723
01:28:25,000 --> 01:28:27,000
AH, YES. HERE, HERE, HERE.

1724
01:28:27,000 --> 01:28:29,000
"YOUR DAUGHTER ELIZABETH,
IT IS PRESUMED

1725
01:28:29,000 --> 01:28:32,000
"WILL NOT LONG BEAR
THE NAME OF BENNET

1726
01:28:32,000 --> 01:28:34,000
"AFTER HER ELDEST SISTER
HAS RESIGNED IT

1727
01:28:34,000 --> 01:28:36,000
"AND THE CHOSEN PARTNER
OF HER FATE

1728
01:28:36,000 --> 01:28:38,000
"MAY BE REASONABLY
LOOKED UP TO

1729
01:28:38,000 --> 01:28:42,000
AS ONE OF THE MOST ILLUSTRIOUS
PERSONAGES IN THE LAND."

1730
01:28:42,000 --> 01:28:44,000
CAN YOU GUESS
WHO HE MEANS, LIZZY? HMM?

1731
01:28:44,000 --> 01:28:46,000
NOW IT COMES OUT.

1732
01:28:46,000 --> 01:28:49,000
"MY MOTIVE FOR CAUTIONING YOU
IS AS FOLLOWS:

1733
01:28:49,000 --> 01:28:51,000
"HIS AUNT,
LADY CATHERINE DE BOURGH

1734
01:28:51,000 --> 01:28:55,000
DOES NOT LOOK ON THE MATCH
WITH A FRIENDLY EYE."

1735
01:28:55,000 --> 01:28:57,000
MR. DARCY, YOU SEE,
IS THE MAN.

1736
01:28:57,000 --> 01:29:00,000
MR. DARCY, OF ALL MEN...

1737
01:29:00,000 --> 01:29:02,000
WHO NEVER LOOKS AT A WOMAN

1738
01:29:02,000 --> 01:29:04,000
EXCEPT TO SEE A BLEMISH.

1739
01:29:04,000 --> 01:29:05,000
ARE YOU NOT DIVERTED?

1740
01:29:05,000 --> 01:29:07,000
OH, YES.

1741
01:29:07,000 --> 01:29:08,000
MR. DARCY,
WHO PROBABLY

1742
01:29:08,000 --> 01:29:11,000
NEVER LOOKED AT YOU
IN HIS LIFE BEFORE.

1743
01:29:11,000 --> 01:29:12,000
THIS IS ADMIRABLE

1744
01:29:12,000 --> 01:29:15,000
BUT, LIZZY, YOU LOOK
AS IF YOU DIDN'T ENJOY IT.

1745
01:29:15,000 --> 01:29:17,000
YOU'RE NOT GOING
TO BE MISSISH NOW

1746
01:29:17,000 --> 01:29:20,000
AND PRETEND TO BE AFFRONTED
BY AN IDLE REPORT?

1747
01:29:20,000 --> 01:29:22,000
NO, NO,
I AM EXCESSIVELY DIVERTED

1748
01:29:22,000 --> 01:29:24,000
BUT IT'S ALL SO STRANGE.

1749
01:29:24,000 --> 01:29:27,000
AND PRAY, WHAT SAID
LADY CATHERINE DE BOURGH?

1750
01:29:27,000 --> 01:29:29,000
I SUPPOSE SHE CAME
TO REFUSE HER CONSENT, EH?

1751
01:29:29,000 --> 01:29:31,000
WELL, WELL, WHAT
DO WE LIVE FOR

1752
01:29:31,000 --> 01:29:34,000
BUT TO MAKE SPORT
FOR OUR NEIGHBORS

1753
01:29:34,000 --> 01:29:36,000
AND LAUGH AT THEM
IN OUR TURN.

1754
01:29:36,000 --> 01:29:40,000
TRUE, TRUE.

1755
01:29:40,000 --> 01:29:42,000
( door closing )

1756
01:29:42,000 --> 01:29:46,000
( clock chiming )

1757
01:29:46,000 --> 01:29:48,000
( door opening )

1758
01:29:48,000 --> 01:29:50,000
MR. BINGLEY
AND MR. DARCY, MA'AM.

1759
01:29:50,000 --> 01:29:53,000
Bingley:
GOOD DAY TO YOU.

1760
01:29:53,000 --> 01:29:55,000
MR. BINGLEY.

1761
01:29:55,000 --> 01:29:57,000
Bingley:
THIS IS A FINE DAY.

1762
01:29:57,000 --> 01:29:58,000
SHOULD WE PERHAPS

1763
01:29:58,000 --> 01:30:03,000
ALL WALK
TOWARD MERYTON?

1764
01:30:08,000 --> 01:30:10,000
Kitty:
LIZZY, DO YOU MIND

1765
01:30:10,000 --> 01:30:14,000
IF I JUST RUN DOWN THE LANE HERE
TO CALL ON MARIA LUCAS?

1766
01:30:14,000 --> 01:30:19,000
NO, NOT AT ALL.

1767
01:30:29,000 --> 01:30:31,000
MR. DARCY...

1768
01:30:31,000 --> 01:30:34,000
I CAN GO NO LONGER
WITHOUT THANKING YOU

1769
01:30:34,000 --> 01:30:37,000
FOR YOUR KINDNESS
TO MY POOR SISTER.

1770
01:30:37,000 --> 01:30:40,000
EVER SINCE
I HAVE KNOWN OF IT

1771
01:30:40,000 --> 01:30:43,000
I'VE BEEN MOST ANXIOUS
TO TELL YOU

1772
01:30:43,000 --> 01:30:45,000
HOW GRATEFUL I AM

1773
01:30:45,000 --> 01:30:47,000
FOR MY FAMILY
AND FOR MYSELF.

1774
01:30:47,000 --> 01:30:50,000
YOU MUST NOT BLAME
MY AUNT FOR TELLING ME.

1775
01:30:50,000 --> 01:30:52,000
LYDIA BETRAYED IT FIRST

1776
01:30:52,000 --> 01:30:56,000
AND THEN I COULDN'T REST
TILL I KNEW EVERYTHING.

1777
01:30:56,000 --> 01:30:59,000
I KNOW WHAT TROUBLE
AND WHAT... MORTIFICATION

1778
01:30:59,000 --> 01:31:01,000
IT MUST HAVE COST YOU.

1779
01:31:01,000 --> 01:31:04,000
PLEASE LET ME SAY THIS.

1780
01:31:04,000 --> 01:31:08,000
PLEASE ALLOW ME TO THANK YOU
ON BEHALF OF ALL MY FAMILY

1781
01:31:08,000 --> 01:31:12,000
SINCE THEY DON'T KNOW
TO WHOM THEY ARE INDEBTED.

1782
01:31:12,000 --> 01:31:14,000
IF YOU WILL THANK ME

1783
01:31:14,000 --> 01:31:16,000
LET IT BE FOR
YOURSELF ALONE.

1784
01:31:16,000 --> 01:31:18,000
YOUR FAMILY
OWES ME NOTHING.

1785
01:31:18,000 --> 01:31:20,000
AS MUCH AS I RESPECT THEM

1786
01:31:20,000 --> 01:31:22,000
I BELIEVE I THOUGHT
ONLY OF YOU.

1787
01:31:22,000 --> 01:31:24,000
YOU ARE TOO GENEROUS
TO TRIFLE WITH ME.

1788
01:31:24,000 --> 01:31:27,000
IF YOUR FEELINGS ARE
WHAT THEY WERE LAST APRIL

1789
01:31:27,000 --> 01:31:29,000
TELL ME SO AT ONCE.

1790
01:31:29,000 --> 01:31:32,000
MY AFFECTIONS AND WISHES
ARE UNCHANGED

1791
01:31:32,000 --> 01:31:34,000
BUT ONE WORD FROM YOU

1792
01:31:34,000 --> 01:31:37,000
WILL SILENCE ME
ON THIS SUBJECT FOREVER.

1793
01:31:37,000 --> 01:31:39,000
OH, MY FEELINGS.

1794
01:31:39,000 --> 01:31:42,000
MY FEELINGS ARE...

1795
01:31:42,000 --> 01:31:46,000
I AM ASHAMED TO REMEMBER
WHAT I SAID THEN.

1796
01:31:46,000 --> 01:31:49,000
MY FEELINGS ARE SO DIFFERENT.

1797
01:31:49,000 --> 01:31:54,000
IN FACT, THEY ARE
QUITE THE OPPOSITE.

1798
01:32:05,000 --> 01:32:08,000
LADY CATHERINE TOLD ME
OF HER MEETING WITH YOU.

1799
01:32:08,000 --> 01:32:10,000
I MAY SAY THAT
HER DISCLOSURE

1800
01:32:10,000 --> 01:32:11,000
HAD QUITE THE
OPPOSITE EFFECT

1801
01:32:11,000 --> 01:32:13,000
TO THE ONE
SHE INTENDED.

1802
01:32:13,000 --> 01:32:15,000
IT TAUGHT ME TO HOPE
AS I'D SCARCELY EVER

1803
01:32:15,000 --> 01:32:17,000
ALLOWED MYSELF
TO HOPE BEFORE.

1804
01:32:17,000 --> 01:32:19,000
I KNEW THAT

1805
01:32:19,000 --> 01:32:21,000
HAD YOU ABSOLUTELY
DECIDED AGAINST ME

1806
01:32:21,000 --> 01:32:23,000
YOU WOULD HAVE
ACKNOWLEDGED IT OPENLY.

1807
01:32:23,000 --> 01:32:25,000
YES, YOU KNOW ENOUGH
OF MY FRANKNESS

1808
01:32:25,000 --> 01:32:27,000
TO BELIEVE ME
CAPABLE OF THAT.

1809
01:32:27,000 --> 01:32:29,000
AFTER ABUSING YOU
SO ABOMINABLY TO YOUR FACE

1810
01:32:29,000 --> 01:32:32,000
I COULD HAVE NO SCRUPLE
IN ABUSING YOU

1811
01:32:32,000 --> 01:32:33,000
TO ALL YOUR RELATIONS.

1812
01:32:33,000 --> 01:32:36,000
WHAT DID YOU SAY TO ME
THAT I DID NOT DESERVE?

1813
01:32:36,000 --> 01:32:40,000
MY BEHAVIOR TO
YOU AT THE TIME
WAS UNPARDONABLE.

1814
01:32:40,000 --> 01:32:43,000
I CAN HARDLY THINK OF IT
WITHOUT ABHORRENCE.

1815
01:32:43,000 --> 01:32:45,000
YOUR REPROOF
I SHALL NEVER FORGET.

1816
01:32:45,000 --> 01:32:48,000
"...HAD YOU BEHAVED IN A
MORE GENTLEMAN-LIKE MANNER."

1817
01:32:48,000 --> 01:32:51,000
YOU KNOW NOT HOW THOSE
WORDS HAVE TORTURED ME.

1818
01:32:51,000 --> 01:32:53,000
I HAD NOT THE SMALLEST IDEA

1819
01:32:53,000 --> 01:32:55,000
OF THEIR EVER BEING TAKEN
IN SUCH A WAY.

1820
01:32:55,000 --> 01:32:57,000
I CAN EASILY BELIEVE IT.

1821
01:32:57,000 --> 01:33:00,000
YOU THOUGHT ME DEVOID
OF EVERY PROPER FEELING.

1822
01:33:00,000 --> 01:33:03,000
THE TURN OF YOUR COUNTENANCE
I SHALL NEVER FORGET

1823
01:33:03,000 --> 01:33:05,000
AND YOU SAID THAT I COULD
NOT HAVE ADDRESSED YOU

1824
01:33:05,000 --> 01:33:07,000
IN ANY POSSIBLE WAY

1825
01:33:07,000 --> 01:33:09,000
THAT WOULD INDUCE
YOU TO ACCEPT ME.

1826
01:33:09,000 --> 01:33:11,000
DO NOT REPEAT
WHAT I SAID THEN.

1827
01:33:11,000 --> 01:33:14,000
I'VE BEEN A SELFISH
BEING ALL MY LIFE.

1828
01:33:14,000 --> 01:33:17,000
AS A CHILD I WAS GIVEN
GOOD PRINCIPLES

1829
01:33:17,000 --> 01:33:20,000
BUT WAS LEFT TO FOLLOW THEM
IN PRIDE AND CONCEIT

1830
01:33:20,000 --> 01:33:23,000
AND SUCH I MIGHT STILL
HAVE BEEN BUT FOR YOU...

1831
01:33:23,000 --> 01:33:28,000
DEAREST,
LOVELIEST ELIZABETH.

1832
01:33:37,000 --> 01:33:39,000
Jane:
ENGAGED TO MR. DARCY?

1833
01:33:39,000 --> 01:33:42,000
NO, YOU
ARE JOKING.

1834
01:33:42,000 --> 01:33:44,000
IT IS
IMPOSSIBLE.

1835
01:33:44,000 --> 01:33:47,000
THIS IS A WRETCHED
BEGINNING.

1836
01:33:47,000 --> 01:33:50,000
IF YOU DON'T BELIEVE ME,
I'M SURE NO ONE ELSE WILL.

1837
01:33:50,000 --> 01:33:52,000
INDEED I AM IN EARNEST.

1838
01:33:52,000 --> 01:33:55,000
HE STILL LOVES ME,
AND WE ARE ENGAGED.

1839
01:33:55,000 --> 01:33:57,000
NO, LIZZY. IT
CAN'T BE TRUE.

1840
01:33:57,000 --> 01:33:59,000
I KNOW HOW MUCH
YOU DISLIKE HIM.

1841
01:33:59,000 --> 01:34:01,000
OH, NO.
IT IS ALL FORGOTTEN.

1842
01:34:01,000 --> 01:34:06,000
PERHAPS I DIDN'T ALWAYS
LOVE HIM AS WELL AS I DO NOW

1843
01:34:06,000 --> 01:34:10,000
BUT IN SUCH CASES AS THESE,
A GOOD MEMORY IS UNPARDONABLE.

1844
01:34:10,000 --> 01:34:13,000
DEAREST LIZZY,
DO BE SERIOUS.

1845
01:34:13,000 --> 01:34:15,000
HOW LONG HAVE
YOU LOVED HIM?

1846
01:34:15,000 --> 01:34:20,000
IT'S BEEN COMING ON
SO GRADUALLY, I HARDLY KNOW

1847
01:34:20,000 --> 01:34:24,000
BUT I BELIEVE I MUST DATE IT
FROM MY FIRST SEEING

1848
01:34:24,000 --> 01:34:27,000
HIS BEAUTIFUL GROUNDS
AT PEMBERLEY.

1849
01:34:27,000 --> 01:34:32,000
LIZZY!

1850
01:34:32,000 --> 01:34:37,000
ARE YOU OUT OF YOUR SENSES
TO BE ACCEPTING THIS MAN, LIZZY?

1851
01:34:37,000 --> 01:34:40,000
HAVE YOU NOT
ALWAYS HATED HIM?

1852
01:34:40,000 --> 01:34:41,000
PAPA...

1853
01:34:41,000 --> 01:34:43,000
I'VE GIVEN HIM MY CONSENT.

1854
01:34:43,000 --> 01:34:45,000
HE'S THE KIND
OF MAN, INDEED

1855
01:34:45,000 --> 01:34:48,000
TO WHOM I SHOULD
NEVER DARE REFUSE ANYTHING

1856
01:34:48,000 --> 01:34:52,000
BUT LET ME ADVISE YOU
TO THINK THE BETTER OF IT.

1857
01:34:52,000 --> 01:34:55,000
I KNOW
YOUR DISPOSITION, LIZZY.

1858
01:34:55,000 --> 01:34:58,000
MY CHILD, LET ME NOT
HAVE THE GRIEF

1859
01:34:58,000 --> 01:35:02,000
OF SEEING YOU UNABLE
TO RESPECT YOUR PARTNER IN LIFE.

1860
01:35:02,000 --> 01:35:04,000
HE'S RICH TO BE SURE

1861
01:35:04,000 --> 01:35:06,000
BUT WILL HE
MAKE YOU HAPPY?

1862
01:35:06,000 --> 01:35:07,000
HAVE YOU ANY OBJECTIONS

1863
01:35:07,000 --> 01:35:09,000
APART FROM YOUR BELIEF
IN MY INDIFFERENCE?

1864
01:35:09,000 --> 01:35:11,000
NONE WHATEVER.

1865
01:35:11,000 --> 01:35:14,000
WE ALL KNOW HIM TO BE
A PROUD, UNPLEASANT
SORT OF MAN

1866
01:35:14,000 --> 01:35:17,000
BUT THIS WOULD BE NOTHING
IF YOU REALLY LIKED HIM.

1867
01:35:17,000 --> 01:35:20,000
I DO.

1868
01:35:20,000 --> 01:35:22,000
I DO LIKE HIM.

1869
01:35:22,000 --> 01:35:25,000
I LOVE HIM.

1870
01:35:25,000 --> 01:35:28,000
INDEED,
HE HAS NO IMPROPER PRIDE.

1871
01:35:28,000 --> 01:35:31,000
HE'S PERFECTLY AMIABLE.

1872
01:35:31,000 --> 01:35:35,000
IF YOU ONLY KNEW
HIS GENEROUS NATURE.

1873
01:35:35,000 --> 01:35:38,000
I DIDN'T ALWAYS LOVE HIM

1874
01:35:38,000 --> 01:35:42,000
BUT I LOVE HIM NOW
SO VERY DEARLY.

1875
01:35:42,000 --> 01:35:47,000
HE IS TRULY THE BEST MAN
I HAVE EVER KNOWN.

1876
01:35:48,000 --> 01:35:53,000
WELL, MY DEAR,
IF THIS BE THE CASE

1877
01:35:53,000 --> 01:35:55,000
HE DESERVES YOU.

1878
01:35:55,000 --> 01:35:58,000
I COULD NOT HAVE PARTED
WITH YOU TO ANYONE

1879
01:35:58,000 --> 01:36:03,000
LESS WORTHY, LIZZY.

1880
01:36:07,000 --> 01:36:11,000
Minister:
DEARLY BELOVED,
WE ARE GATHERED HERE

1881
01:36:11,000 --> 01:36:12,000
IN THE SIGHT OF GOD

1882
01:36:12,000 --> 01:36:15,000
AND IN THE FACE
OF THIS CONGREGATION

1883
01:36:15,000 --> 01:36:20,000
TO JOIN TOGETHER
THIS MAN AND THIS WOMAN...

1884
01:36:22,000 --> 01:36:27,000
AND THIS MAN AND THIS WOMAN

1885
01:36:27,000 --> 01:36:29,000
IN HOLY MATRIMONY

1886
01:36:29,000 --> 01:36:31,000
WHICH IS AN HONORABLE ESTATE

1887
01:36:31,000 --> 01:36:35,000
INSTITUTED BY GOD
IN THE TIME OF MAN'S INNOCENCY

1888
01:36:35,000 --> 01:36:36,000
SIGNIFYING UNTO US

1889
01:36:36,000 --> 01:36:38,000
THE MYSTICAL UNION

1890
01:36:38,000 --> 01:36:41,000
THAT IS BETWEEN CHRIST
AND HIS CHURCH

1891
01:36:41,000 --> 01:36:42,000
AND THEREFORE

1892
01:36:42,000 --> 01:36:46,000
IS NOT BY ANY
TO BE ENTERPRISED LIGHTLY

1893
01:36:46,000 --> 01:36:50,000
OR WANTONLY TO SATISFY
MAN'S CARNAL LUSTS AND APPETITES

1894
01:36:50,000 --> 01:36:55,000
BUT REVERENTLY, DISCREETLY,
ADVISEDLY, SOBERLY

1895
01:36:55,000 --> 01:36:58,000
AND IN THE FEAR OF GOD,
DULY CONSIDERING THE CAUSES

1896
01:36:58,000 --> 01:37:00,000
FOR WHICH MATRIMONY
WAS ORDAINED.

1897
01:37:00,000 --> 01:37:05,000
FIRST, IT WAS ORDAINED
FOR THE PROCREATION

1898
01:37:05,000 --> 01:37:07,000
OF CHILDREN.

1899
01:37:07,000 --> 01:37:11,000
SECONDLY,
AS A REMEDY AGAINST SIN

1900
01:37:11,000 --> 01:37:15,000
AND TO AVOID FORNICATION.

1901
01:37:15,000 --> 01:37:17,000
THIRDLY

1902
01:37:17,000 --> 01:37:20,000
FOR THE MUTUAL SOCIETY,
HELP AND COMFORT

1903
01:37:20,000 --> 01:37:23,000
THAT THE ONE
OUGHT TO HAVE OF THE OTHER

1904
01:37:23,000 --> 01:37:26,000
BOTH IN PROSPERITY AND ADVERSITY

1905
01:37:26,000 --> 01:37:27,000
INTO WHICH HOLY ESTATE

1906
01:37:27,000 --> 01:37:32,000
THESE PERSONS PRESENT
COME NOW TO BE JOINED.

1907
01:37:33,000 --> 01:37:38,000
( cheering )

1908
01:37:58,000 --> 01:38:03,000
( all yelling congratulations )

1909
01:38:21,000 --> 01:38:23,000
THREE DAUGHTERS MARRIED.

1910
01:38:23,000 --> 01:38:26,000
OH, MR. BENNET,
GOD HAS BEEN VERY GOOD TO US.

1911
01:38:26,000 --> 01:38:29,000
YES, SO IT WOULD SEEM.

